        itemId = 32314,
        name = "Green Riding Nether Ray",
        stepCount = 10,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the Skettis unlock and repeat reputation farming to Exalted; all five colors share that standing.\n\n1. Begin with Yuula beside Shattrath's flight master around 64.0, 42.0. Complete Threat from Above by killing 20 Gordunni ogres in the Barrier Hills north of the city, around 22.0, 12.0 on the Terokkar Forest map. Return to Yuula, then follow To Skettis to Sky Commander Adaris at Blackwind Landing, 64.0, 66.8. If already Exalted with Sha'tari Skyguard, skip to step 10.\n\n2. At Blackwind Landing, take World of Shadows from Severin. Kill Skettis arakkoa and collect 6 Shadow Dust, then return to Severin at 64.0, 66.8 for Elixir of Shadows. Keep the elixir buff active to see the otherwise hidden time-lost arakkoa.\n\n3. While clearing Skettis, kill Talonpriest Ishaal around 69.3, 78.5 and loot Ishaal's Almanac. Use the item to start its quest and take it to Adaris at Blackwind Landing. Continue with An Ally in Lower City.\n\n4. Take the almanac to Rilak the Redeemed in Shattrath's Lower City at 52.6, 20.8. Accept Countdown to Doom and return to Adaris. This unlock chain is needed for Hazzik's summoning quests; simply grinding ordinary birds does not complete it.\n\n5. Speak to Hazzik beside Adaris at 64.2, 66.8. For Hazzik's Bargain, retrieve the small package inside the ground-level hut in UPPER Veil Shil'ak at 74.8, 80.2, then return to Hazzik. Do not search the similarly named lower settlement or the platforms in the trees.\n\n6. Accept A Shabby Disguise. Use the supplied disguise on the central island, enter Sahaak's hut around 67.0, 79.0, and buy Adversarial Bloodlines for 3 gold. Bring the book to Hazzik and accept Adversarial Blood.\n\n7. Keep Elixir of Shadows active and kill time-lost arakkoa for Time-Lost Scrolls. Gather 40 scrolls for a complete four-descendant cycle. At a small Skull Pile, for example 69.6, 74.6, spend 10 scrolls per summon and kill each DIFFERENT descendant once: Darkscreecher Akkarai, Karrog, Gezzarak the Huntress and Vakkiz the Windrager. Loot and keep their four distinct token items.\n\n8. Turn in Adversarial Blood to Hazzik for your first Time-Lost Offering. For later Offerings, use Tokens of the Descendants to trade one of each descendant token to Hazzik. Take Terokk's Downfall from Adaris. On Terokk's Rest island at 66.2, 77.5, use the large Skull Pile with an Offering in your bags to summon and defeat Terokk, then turn in the quest.\n\n9. Continue earning reputation until Sha'tari Skyguard is Exalted. Kill arakkoa and the large treants while collecting dust and scrolls, repeat the four-descendant token exchange and Terokk summons, and refresh Elixir of Shadows. Terokk's pile normally returns about 15 minutes after a kill; farm elsewhere while waiting. If he shields, bring him into the blue fire from the Skyguard bombing run. You can buy tradable scrolls/offerings on the Auction House to shorten gathering.\n\n10. At Exalted, return to Grella at Blackwind Landing, 64.2, 66.2 in Terokkar Forest. Buy Green Riding Nether Ray for the normal Exalted price of 160 gold and use the item from your bags. The same reputation unlocks all five colors; buy the missing colors separately.",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=32314",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the Skettis unlock and repeat reputation farming to Exalted; all five colors share that standing.",
        difficulty = "medium",
    },
