ur free Azure Netherwing Drake. Only the first chosen color is free. If you already chose a different drake, use step 12 instead.\n\n12. For additional colors, return to Drake Dealer Hurlunk on Netherwing Ledge at 65.6, 86.0 while Exalted on this character. Buy Reins of the Azure Netherwing Drake for 200 gold if it is still missing, then use the reins. You can keep and learn all six colors; purchasing a second does not replace the first.",
